WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:07.050
I wonder what it will be?  
This week, it's this!

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.760
All right!  It's Majestic Star Dragon!

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:11.990
Do your best, Yusei!

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:12.840
Its attack is…

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:14.990
Shooting Blaster Sonic!

00:00:44.470 --> 00:00:46.400
Black Rose Flare!

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:51.680
Eternal Sunshine!

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:57.840
It's almost time.

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:03.510
When the king of the underworld arrives at 
the altar and I offer you as a sacrifice...

00:01:03.510 --> 00:01:05.910
...the world will be trapped in hell!

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.060
I'll destroy everything 
and return it to zero!

00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:09.700
Do whatever it takes to stop him!

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:13.620
Of course!  His laughter disgusts me!

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:32.650
Looking over a vast distance

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:37.760
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:42.660
Even if it's easier to throw myself away

00:01:43.030 --> 00:01:47.430
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:52.800
No matter how bad today is

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:57.780
There's still the faintest light

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:03.180
All I have to do tomorrow

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:07.250
Is light it myself

00:02:07.550 --> 00:02:12.260
I test myself so I won't stop or vanish

00:02:12.630 --> 00:02:17.230
Even if I get countless scars

00:02:17.730 --> 00:02:23.530
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:27.500
Today will never exist again

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:33.410
So I won't stop or vanish

00:02:57.070 --> 00:03:02.620
To Our Future!

00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:09.760
My turn!

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:14.840
Jack's field is empty, so 
Godwin will target him.

00:03:15.310 --> 00:03:18.510
I flip over my trap card Fiendish Chain!

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:23.980
Sun Dragon Inti's effect is negated, and 
it also can't attack or be released!

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:29.900
All right!  Sun Dragon Inti can't 
attack him directly anymore!

00:03:29.900 --> 00:03:30.860
However…

00:03:33.820 --> 00:03:41.030
Jack Atlas, you said that no matter how much 
a person throws away, he will never be alone.

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:45.260
You're wrong.  A person 
can easily become alone.

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:47.040
By dying.

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:53.850
When a person faces death, he realizes 
that he doesn't have friends or bonds.

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:55.550
But that's normal.

00:03:55.550 --> 00:03:58.820
Death is a solo adventure.

00:03:59.730 --> 00:04:00.990
Godwin…

00:04:00.990 --> 00:04:04.110
I'll turn you back to your 
old self, Jack Atlas!

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:06.960
When you were helplessly 
alone and facing death!

00:04:07.130 --> 00:04:11.690
Due to Earthbound Immortal Wiraqocha 
Rasca, I skip this turn's Battle Phase!

00:04:11.690 --> 00:04:15.540
Jack drops to 1 life point!

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:18.470
Polar Star Obey!

00:04:22.550 --> 00:04:26.880
When I have 1000 or fewer life 
points, Fiendish Chain is destroyed.

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:33.550
Watch and feel death coming towards you!

00:04:33.550 --> 00:04:37.790
King of the underworld, I offer 
you Jack Atlas as a sacrifice!

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:44.150
What is that?

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:56.290
Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:57.480
What power!

00:05:04.550 --> 00:05:05.380
Jack!

00:05:05.550 --> 00:05:10.350
Jack, do you feel death and helplessness?

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:12.940
I don't feel helplessly alone!

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:16.290
Because we're not facing death!

00:05:21.230 --> 00:05:22.200
Jack!

00:05:24.810 --> 00:05:29.380
Yusei, I'm counting on you.

00:05:29.380 --> 00:05:35.650
Even if my D-Wheel can't 
move, I'm still with you!

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:40.360
Jack's right.

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:46.460
Even though we only have 1 life point, 
our emotions are worth 10000 points.

00:05:46.460 --> 00:05:48.160
Do your best, Yusei!

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:50.160
Don't lose!

00:05:50.770 --> 00:05:54.180
All their hopes are with me!

00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:59.940
Since you're facing death, you're 
pretending to hide your fear.

00:05:59.940 --> 00:06:02.930
I set one card and end my turn.

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:06.800
My turn!

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:09.280
I activate Junk Archer's effect!

00:06:09.280 --> 00:06:12.680
Once a turn, I can remove 
one monster from play!

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:14.690
I remove Sun Dragon Inti!

00:06:14.690 --> 00:06:16.760
Dimension Shoot!

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:18.690
You never give up.

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:21.780
I activate the Counter 
Trap Passion of Baimasse!

00:06:21.780 --> 00:06:26.060
It negates your monster's 
effect and destroys it!

00:06:27.470 --> 00:06:29.900
I summon Shield Warrior in defense position!

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:35.070
I set one card and end my turn.

00:06:36.470 --> 00:06:38.490
Their hopes are with you?

00:06:38.490 --> 00:06:41.680
And the best you can do is summon 
a monster in defense position?

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:45.680
Defense is pointless against 
Earthbound Immortal Wiraqocha Rasca!

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:51.960
Yusei Fudo, you'll learn that you're 
helpless and alone when you're facing death!

00:06:51.960 --> 00:06:54.660
You'll find that there are no bonds!

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:56.970
My turn!

00:06:57.630 --> 00:07:00.400
You're going to end up the same as them.

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:04.130
I activate Earthbound Immortal 
Wiraqocha Rasca's effect!

00:07:04.130 --> 00:07:08.710
By skipping the Battle Phase, 
your life points become 1!

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:11.480
Polar Star Obey!

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:15.930
Yusei!

00:07:15.930 --> 00:07:16.750
Yusei…

00:07:21.450 --> 00:07:27.590
Your combined life points is 
3.  You must feel helpless.

00:07:35.380 --> 00:07:38.800
No, I still won't give up.

00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:42.470
As long as there's hope, 
I'll never feel helpless!

00:07:42.470 --> 00:07:46.540
My bond of friendship gives me hope!

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:48.810
You're still saying that?

00:07:48.810 --> 00:07:50.280
My turn!

00:07:51.290 --> 00:07:54.380
I activate Speed Spell - 
Angel Baton from my hand!

00:07:54.810 --> 00:07:59.030
When I have 2 or more Speed Counters, 
I draw two cards from my deck.

00:07:59.030 --> 00:08:01.960
Then I send one card in 
my hand to the graveyard.

00:08:02.240 --> 00:08:05.430
I summon the Tuner Monster Debris Dragon!

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:11.250
When Debris Dragon is successfully summoned, I can Special

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:14.950
Summon one monster in my graveyard with 500-or-fewer attack points.

00:08:14.950 --> 00:08:16.970
Come, Sonic Chick!

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:24.010
Level 4 Debris Dragon tunes Level 1 
Sonic Chick and Level 3 Shield Warrior!

00:08:24.680 --> 00:08:27.950
The wishes come together 
to form a new shining star!

00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:29.520
Become the path that lights the way!

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:31.770
Synchro Summon!

00:08:31.770 --> 00:08:34.500
Soar, Stardust Dragon!

00:08:37.180 --> 00:08:40.550
Your hopes have reached their limit.  
It doesn't have enough attack points.

00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:44.030
Wrong!  Hope will never fail as long 
as I have my bond of friendship!

00:08:44.030 --> 00:08:45.300
What are you talking about?

00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:49.770
I use the effect of Blackwing - Bombardment, 
the Continuous Trap that Crow left behind!

00:08:51.060 --> 00:08:54.150
By sending Blackwing - Bombardment to the graveyard,

00:08:54.150 --> 00:08:57.550
Stardust Dragon's attack points increase by 2500 until the End Phase!

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:58.470
What?

00:08:58.470 --> 00:09:00.890
This is the power of Armor Master, who was

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:03.490
paid as a cost to activate Blackwing - Bombardment!

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:09.390
Stardust Dragon attacks Sun Dragon Inti!

00:09:09.390 --> 00:09:11.400
Shooting Sonic!

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:20.900
The monster that destroyed Sun Dragon Inti is also

00:09:20.900 --> 00:09:24.400
destroyed, and you take damage equal to its attack points!

00:09:25.170 --> 00:09:27.950
Stardust Dragon's effect overcomes that!

00:09:27.950 --> 00:09:33.220
By releasing Stardust Dragon, the card 
destruction effect is negated and destroyed!

00:09:33.220 --> 00:09:35.280
Victim's Sanctuary!

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:43.240
When the sun sets, the moon 
rises.  Then the sun rises again.

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:47.830
No one can stop the flow of nature!

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:51.210
I Special Summon Moon Dragon 
Quilla from my graveyard!

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:53.570
I don't think so!

00:09:58.430 --> 00:10:00.210
That's Jack's card!

00:10:00.210 --> 00:10:01.880
We've connected...

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:03.010
...our bond.

00:10:03.010 --> 00:10:07.620
I activate the Continuous Trap Conquest 
of the Supreme Ruler on Jack's field!

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:13.740
By sending this card to the graveyard, 
your monster's summoning is negated!

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:16.610
Impossible!

00:10:16.610 --> 00:10:21.080
At the End Phase of this turn, Stardust 
Dragon resurrects from my graveyard!

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:26.800
I end my turn.

00:10:26.990 --> 00:10:30.770
Godwin, as long as we have 
this bond, we're never alone.

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:34.510
We don't feel helpless.  
You should know that too!

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:35.960
What are you talking about?

00:10:35.960 --> 00:10:41.630
I've reached the limits of total 
loneliness and helplessness!

00:10:41.630 --> 00:10:46.950
If I don't surpass humanity and become a 
god, I won't be able to reset the world!

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:49.960
Does that mean you've forgotten 
about your brother Rutger?

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:50.940
What?

00:10:50.940 --> 00:10:55.400
In the past, you fought against destiny and 
created the legend of the Daedalus Bridge.

00:10:55.400 --> 00:11:01.310
Weren't you trying to 
carry on Rutger's legacy?

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:05.710
Brother…

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:13.130
Your left arm belonged 
to your brother Rutger.

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:15.710
So what?

00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:18.920
Face reality!  You only have 1 life point!

00:11:18.920 --> 00:11:22.540
And the king of the underworld 
is already nearby!

00:11:22.540 --> 00:11:30.160
Since the other two can no longer drive, 
I win when you run out of life points!

00:11:56.370 --> 00:11:58.300
My turn!

00:11:59.460 --> 00:12:05.850
Yusei Fudo, I attack you directly with 
Earthbound Immortal Wiraqocha Rasca!

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:09.940
I'll blow out your life 
like a candle in the wind!

00:12:09.940 --> 00:12:12.520
Death Singularity!

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:19.550
Yusei!

00:12:19.790 --> 00:12:23.250
Now's the time to use that card!

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:27.640
Jack!  So that's why you 
didn't use this card!

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:31.830
Godwin!  Our bond of friendship is my weapon!

00:12:32.500 --> 00:12:35.090
I activate the Continuous Trap Scrubbed Raid!

00:12:35.090 --> 00:12:40.120
By sending one card on my field to 
the graveyard, the Battle Phase ends.

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:41.830
I release Scrubbed Raid!

00:12:48.260 --> 00:12:52.180
In that case, I activate 
the trap card Meteor Flare!

00:12:52.180 --> 00:12:57.720
I send two cards in my hand to my graveyard 
to deal you 2000 points of damage!

00:12:57.720 --> 00:13:00.460
I flip over the trap card Joint Future!

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:05.630
I send one card in my hand to the graveyard 
to negate your spell or trap card's activation!

00:13:05.630 --> 00:13:09.770
But since Meteor Flare finished 
activating, it goes to the graveyard.

00:13:09.770 --> 00:13:12.940
When this card is in my graveyard during the Draw

00:13:12.940 --> 00:13:16.640
Phase, I can add this card to my hand instead of drawing.

00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:18.270
I won't let it go to the graveyard!

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:22.830
When Joint Future negates a card's effect, 
that card returns to the deck and is shuffled!

00:13:22.830 --> 00:13:23.720
What?

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:30.620
I end my turn.

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:36.620
Godwin, I know you don't 
want to become a god!

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:39.460
There's no way you can 
forget about your brother!

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:43.300
Whatever!  If I don't surpass my 
brother, I can't become a god!

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:46.770
You're wrong!  There are things 
that you can never forget!

00:13:47.950 --> 00:13:53.980
Everyone has something in their 
hearts that can never be lost!

00:13:54.940 --> 00:13:58.650
You have Rutger inside your heart!

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:02.180
You don't want to become a 
god and overcome destiny!

00:14:02.180 --> 00:14:05.640
You and Rutger want to 
oppose destiny together!

00:14:05.640 --> 00:14:09.170
That's the very definition of a bond.

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:16.600
Brother...

00:14:17.880 --> 00:14:19.080
Rex…

00:14:23.580 --> 00:14:24.780
Brother!

00:14:29.650 --> 00:14:31.040
What's this?

00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:35.550
What?

00:14:36.420 --> 00:14:37.290
The mark…

00:14:38.090 --> 00:14:39.260
It's back.

00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:43.290
The mark of the Crimson Dragon.

00:14:43.530 --> 00:14:45.800
It's giving us power.

00:14:48.600 --> 00:14:50.800
I have the mark of the dragon head?

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:54.470
This is…

00:14:54.470 --> 00:15:01.190
Why?  Didn't Crimson Dragon choose 
me because I'm going to become a god?

00:15:01.190 --> 00:15:03.390
You're wrong!  It chose our bond!

00:15:03.390 --> 00:15:06.730
With our bond, we will overcome destiny!

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:10.950
Yusei!

00:15:11.920 --> 00:15:15.390
My turn!

00:15:17.340 --> 00:15:24.230
When Stardust Dragon is on my field, I can 
Special Summon Stardust Xiaolong from my graveyard!

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:30.240
Then I summon Majestic Dragon!

00:15:33.710 --> 00:15:35.280
That card is…

00:15:35.590 --> 00:15:42.330
Level 1 Majestic Dragon tunes Level 8 
Stardust Dragon and Level 1 Stardust Xiaolong!

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:49.350
This is bad!  It's the 
king of the underworld!

00:15:51.740 --> 00:15:55.730
The shining stars come together 
to illuminate a new miracle!

00:15:55.730 --> 00:15:57.730
Become the path that lights the way!

00:15:58.470 --> 00:15:59.920
Synchro Summon!

00:15:59.920 --> 00:16:03.170
Bring the light, Majestic Star Dragon!

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:13.520
Majestic Star Dragon's effect negates 
Earthbound Immortal Wiraqocha Rasca's effect!

00:16:13.520 --> 00:16:14.180
What?

00:16:14.180 --> 00:16:17.320
Next, I flip over my trap card Synchro Baton!

00:16:17.320 --> 00:16:21.340
For every Synchro Monster in our graveyards, the attack

00:16:21.340 --> 00:16:25.540
points of a Synchro Monster on my field increase by 600 points!

00:16:25.950 --> 00:16:28.380
There are four Synchro 
Monsters in our graveyards!

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:31.220
Our bond now comes together!

00:16:32.040 --> 00:16:36.280
Majestic Star Dragon 
gains 2400 attack points!

00:16:38.040 --> 00:16:42.250
Majestic Star Dragon attacks 
Earthbound Immortal Wiraqocha Rasca!

00:16:42.250 --> 00:16:44.680
Shooting Blaster Sonic!

00:16:47.230 --> 00:16:49.290
Yusei Fudo...

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:28.930
Kiryu…  Bommer…

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:38.100
Godwin.

00:17:42.560 --> 00:17:43.770
Brother…

00:17:46.240 --> 00:17:50.180
We took the long road to get here.

00:17:50.830 --> 00:17:52.180
Rex…

00:17:52.970 --> 00:17:58.390
Yusei Fudo, I would've never 
known if it wasn't for you.

00:17:58.860 --> 00:18:00.090
Godwin.

00:18:00.340 --> 00:18:06.540
The bond between friends is 
the way to oppose destiny.

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:11.530
It was something that was always inside me.

00:18:13.810 --> 00:18:16.710
Yusei, take care of them.

00:18:17.340 --> 00:18:19.410
They will soon resurrect.

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:23.410
We will end destiny...

00:18:24.260 --> 00:18:26.530
…with our brotherly bond.

00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:30.420
Let's go.

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:34.180
Wait!

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:02.130
Godwin!

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:12.070
Master Atlas!

00:19:12.070 --> 00:19:12.800
Crow!

00:19:26.670 --> 00:19:28.630
Hey!

00:20:02.110 --> 00:20:03.680
Take a look.

00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:06.460
I received a postcard from Misty yesterday.

00:20:06.460 --> 00:20:08.320
She seems busy as usual.

00:20:08.320 --> 00:20:09.170
I see.

00:20:09.170 --> 00:20:13.890
Bommer and Kiryu are also traveling, 
and they won't be back for awhile.

00:20:13.890 --> 00:20:16.220
Come to think of it, Yusei is late.

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:19.550
Jack and Crow aren't here either.

00:20:19.550 --> 00:20:20.810
What?

00:20:21.410 --> 00:20:23.770
Isn't it strange that 
those three aren't here?

00:20:23.770 --> 00:20:27.230
It may be a lead to a huge scoop!

00:20:27.230 --> 00:20:29.970
But aren't you a great source for leads?

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:33.990
I don't remember anything 
after I became a Dark Signer!

00:20:33.990 --> 00:20:36.610
No one in the City remembers anything either!

00:20:36.610 --> 00:20:38.850
It's frustrating!

00:20:39.970 --> 00:20:44.920
But it's great that everyone in the 
City and Satellite are back safely.

00:20:49.830 --> 00:20:53.130
We finally did it.

00:20:53.130 --> 00:20:54.020
Yeah.

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:57.570
I'm not dreaming, am I?

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:01.380
It was a long battle.

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:06.130
Now Satellite and City have become one.

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:10.610
The legend of the Daedalus 
Bridge has become a reality.

00:21:10.610 --> 00:21:13.660
But there's something that 
we haven't completed yet.

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:17.590
I know what it is!  It's 
the battle between us!

00:21:17.590 --> 00:21:19.200
Let's do it!

00:21:21.020 --> 00:21:24.450
Let's go, Jack and Crow!  To our future!

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:40.780
Riding Duel!  Acceleration!

00:21:57.710 --> 00:22:02.180
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:02.540 --> 00:22:07.250
We will build our own future

00:22:07.720 --> 00:22:12.690
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:13.150 --> 00:22:17.860
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:23.460 --> 00:22:33.000
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:33.430 --> 00:22:38.570
This world can't be solved using algorithms

00:22:38.640 --> 00:22:43.280
Even if it loses its light

00:22:43.750 --> 00:22:48.550
The hourglass behind the 
heart can't be turned

00:22:48.550 --> 00:22:53.020
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:22:53.220 --> 00:22:58.600
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:22:58.730 --> 00:23:03.480
This journey has no end

00:23:03.700 --> 00:23:08.940
There's no meaning because there are no tears

00:23:09.370 --> 00:23:14.180
Hear my voice
